  "interpretation_boundary": [
    "All six environments contain the same 1,139 training configurations and use the same ACE training and independent test contracts.",
    "The environments vary label provenance and DFT reference cost rather than configuration identity.",
    "DFT fractions are measured over atomic environments and are not equivalent to configuration fractions.",
    "The uncertainty threshold was validated across separate public DFT datasets before the tungsten downstream model comparison.",
    "The two endpoint panels share one material system and one test distribution, so they provide a source-level stress test rather than broad materials support."
  ],
